    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730-a6">

                <pb facs="0846" n="726" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg726"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Pearson to Mrs. Labaree.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-01-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 3,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Sterling equivalent to $30,000 indemnity for yourself and children was paid to me
                    to-day. Execute power of attorney agent here to receive amount. Agreement
                    expressly provides against any special tax or other device or pretext to
                    reimburse government and requires swift punishment of all guilty. Your letter
                    received; am answering fully.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pearson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
